Error [jet.NeverFunctionReturnsValue]: Function `value` promises `Never` but returns a value.
  --> Tests/UI/never_return_value.jet:1:31
    |
  1 | value: fn() -> Never { return 1 }
    |                               ^
 Why: A declared `Never` return has no success value.
 Fix: Remove the value and diverge, or change the return type.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2425
